>\n<p>B. The reaction has a half-life of 500 s.</p>\n<p>C. The time required for 10% completion is 25 times the time required for 90% completion.</p>\n<p>D. The degree of dissociation is equal to (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.801ex\" height=\"2.117ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -853.7 3448 935.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(722.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1722.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(477,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"6B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6B\"></use><use data-c=\"74\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-74\" transform=\"translate(528,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>)</p>\n<p>E. The rate and the rate constant have the same unit.</p>",
